// checks, std::bad_alloc) cannot cross the C ABI, so every exported
// function wraps the C++ API in a try/catch: they are translated into a
// status code plus a thread-local message readable via vk_last_error() /
// vk_last_error_code(). See capi.hpp for the full contract.
